  "title": {
   "en": "Ryu no Hanayome wa Oni no Uso ni Oboreru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "龍の花嫁は鬼の嘘に溺れる"
   },
   {
    "en": "Maiden of the Dragon: Falling for the Demon's Lies"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Dragon Bride Ensnared by the Devil's Lies"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“As for me… I see them as beautiful dragon scales.”\n\nTamaki was born into a clan blessed by the Dragon God. But unlike the others, she was the only one said to be enchanted by snakes—an accusation that led to her being labeled a fraud and deeply ostracized.Fearing she might truly turn into a “serpent” as people whispered, she pushed herself relentlessly in daily training, hoping to prove she truly belonged to her family.As her sixteenth birthday—known as the Day of Prophecy—approached, she knew her fate would be decided.But on the awaited day, nothing went as expected. Instead, she suddenly encountered Ren, a young leader from the clan of Divine Demons— and in that moment, everything in her life began to change."
  },
